sequenceDiagram
  actor F as Staff
  participant T as To Do
  participant W as Log Walk-in or Delivery
  participant L as Borrowed Gallons
  participant D as Order Details
  participant S as Server
  F->>T: 1: Log in as Staff
  T->>S: 2: GET /api/work/todo
  S-->>T: 3: Tank counter, Processing orders
  alt Log Walk-in or Log Delivery
    F->>T: 4: Tap Log Walk-in or Log Delivery
    T->>W: 5: Open the form
    F->>W: 6: Fill in, Save
    W->>S: 7: POST /api/work/walk-in or /api/work/delivery
  else Borrowed Gallons
    F->>T: 8: Tap Borrowed Gallons
    T->>L: 9: Lend or mark returned
  else Processing orders
    F->>T: 10: Tap an order
    T->>D: 11: Order Details (view only)
    F->>T: 12: Select orders, Mark selected Out for Delivery
    T->>S: 13: POST /api/work/out
    S-->>T: 14: Sent out, tank counter up, seals down
  end
  S-->>T: 15: Tank alert when the counter reaches the limit
